1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:34.850
<b>Justice Will Prevail!!</b>

3
00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:37.940
Hurry to the execution platform!

4
00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:41.570
The Giant Squad is coming!

5
00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:45.480
They're targeting Little Oars Jr.!

6
00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:50.460
Stopping that thing...

7
00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:52.050
... is our duty!

8
00:02:55.990 --> 00:02:58.060
His size is unbelievable...

9
00:02:58.060 --> 00:03:01.090
He's more than twice as large as any ordinary Giant!

10
00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:02.540
Keep shooting!

11
00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:05.940
He's only flesh and blood... he can't be invulnerable!

12
00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:21.010
They brought one hell of an ally.

13
00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:25.950
Fire! Shoot him down!

14
00:03:27.820 --> 00:03:29.900
Oars! Forget about it!

15
00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:33.120
Your size makes you too easy a target!

16
00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:35.490
Ace-kun!

17
00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:45.540
I'm coming for ya!

18
00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:56.630
This is bad!

19
00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:57.780
Stop him!

20
00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:16.570
Oars opened a path into the bay!

21
00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:21.930
Invade the bay!

22
00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:30.030
<b>Plaza</b>
<b>The Seven
Warlords</b>
<b>Oars</b>

23
00:04:30.260 --> 00:04:33.210
Fall back! Fortify the shoreline!

24
00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:34.920
Don't let them reach the plaza!

25
00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:46.290
I've never had to look up at someone before!

26
00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:47.600
You said it!

27
00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:49.560
This is as far as you get!

28
00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:12.560
Vice Admiral Lacroix!

29
00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:19.160
That Oars... No point trying to hold him back...

30
00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:22.400
There's a difference between being a hero and throwing your life away!

31
00:05:23.110 --> 00:05:27.380
Old Man, please don't stop me!

32
00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:30.110
I wanna save 'im!

33
00:05:30.110 --> 00:05:35.780
I wanna save Ace-kun as fast as possible!

34
00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:38.980
I hear ya.

35
00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:44.410
Men! Wipe your asses!
Let's give Oars some support!

36
00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:45.660
Yeah!

37
00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:53.130
How do we fight a guy this big?!

38
00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:02.520
How dare you hurt Vice Admiral Lacroix!

39
00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:23.600
If you get distracted by Oars, I'll take you down!

40
00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:44.490
H-Hey! Guys!

41
00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:47.640
The Pirate Empress, I'm guessing?

42
00:06:52.330 --> 00:06:54.830
My body's... crumbling?!

43
00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:15.210
Hey! What do you think you're doing, attacking marines?!

44
00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:19.330
I agreed to fight against Whitebeard...

45
00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:22.520
but I never said I would be your ally.

46
00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:26.160
Whether enemies or friends, all men are the same!

47
00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:29.240
All but one man...

48
00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:34.330
I want to leave here with my promise fulfilled.

49
00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:35.570
What are you saying?!

50
00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:42.410
Can you forgive this beauty?

51
00:07:42.410 --> 00:07:45.540
Y-You...!

52
00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:00.820
You!

53
00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:20.080
I'll save ya now!

54
00:08:20.420 --> 00:08:22.250
Oars...

55
00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:18.570
Oars!

56
00:09:28.510 --> 00:09:31.310
That's enough! Stop this!

57
00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:34.290
You won't make it this far!

58
00:09:36.480 --> 00:09:38.100
Me?

59
00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:45.060
I learned how to make it in the Wano Country.

60
00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:47.490
Try it on!

61
00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:53.280
Ace-san burned the darn thing twice trying to make that hat.

62
00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:56.710
A fire man like him shouldn't be weaving straw.

63
00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:03.180
Whoa! It's much cooler now!

64
00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:05.950
Really? Great!

65
00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:18.530
Aim for Oars!

66
00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:30.320
Oars!

67
00:10:30.320 --> 00:10:32.040
I guess there was no chance.

68
00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:33.410
He's such a big target!

69
00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:42.740
Captain Oars!

70
00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:44.900
What are you doing outside?

71
00:10:46.300 --> 00:10:49.730
Hmm... I don't even get wet by the rain...

72
00:10:50.740 --> 00:10:52.980
It's really sturdy.

73
00:10:52.980 --> 00:10:55.340
This is great!

74
00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:02.280
At the very least...

75
00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:06.920
Even if it's just one of the Warlords...

76
00:11:25.770 --> 00:11:28.860
Is something wrong, demon?

77
00:11:28.860 --> 00:11:30.300
My legs won't...

78
00:11:31.510 --> 00:11:32.870
Captain!

79
00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:37.620
Captain! Why are you outside again?

80
00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:41.110
The snow doesn't even reach me.

81
00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:44.100
I'm not cold at all!

82
00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:47.340
This is really good!

83
00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:50.420
Thanks, Ace-

84
00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:01.950
How fun!

85
00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:09.040
Oars!

86
00:12:27.740 --> 00:12:29.580
I-It's the monster!

87
00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:35.470
He's breached the plaza!

88
00:12:43.340 --> 00:12:46.310
Just a little more...

89
00:12:50.070 --> 00:12:54.750
Just a little further to Ace-kun...

90
00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:03.150
That Doflamingo bastard!

91
00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:05.460
He's gone and cut off a leg!

92
00:13:05.460 --> 00:13:08.100
Even though I said I wanted the corpse...

93
00:13:11.440 --> 00:13:13.570
Go!

94
00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:19.540
Oars!

95
00:13:34.260 --> 00:13:37.660
Look! This is the right way to kill someone!

96
00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:39.560
Captain Oars!

97
00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:42.800
Damn the Seven Warlords!

98
00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:43.900
Captain!

99
00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:45.570
Oars!

100
00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:15.530
Oars!

101
00:14:32.980 --> 00:14:38.320
If I use his corpse, I can create the ultimate zombie warrior!

102
00:14:47.930 --> 00:14:50.430
Oars...

103
00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:53.940
You're wide open, Whitebeard!

104
00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:08.590
Vice Admiral Ronse!

105
00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:22.800
H-He beat a Giant -

106
00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:26.070
and a Navy HQ vice admiral at that - effortlessly!

107
00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:38.550
Charge across Oars!

108
00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:43.290
<b>Marineford - Inside the Bay</b>

109
00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:09.660
This is priceless!

110
00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:12.840
Doflamingo! How could you do that to Oars?!

111
00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:14.990
I won't let you get away with this!

112
00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:17.590
What's so funny?!

113
00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:19.690
You wanna know what's so funny?

114
00:16:19.690 --> 00:16:22.210
This feeling of being right at the center of an era, that's what!

115
00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:27.260
This is the turning point!

116
00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:29.370
Quit spouting nonsense!

117
00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:32.610
Just as I'd expect of the commander!

118
00:16:32.610 --> 00:16:34.680
Doflamingo is running away from him!

119
00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:47.340
Impossible! This is just too much for me!

120
00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:49.500
I'm too scared to do anything!

121
00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:53.210
So many strong people are falling, one after another!

122
00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:55.640
There's nothing I can do here!

123
00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:56.890
Someone like me can't...

124
00:16:57.340 --> 00:16:59.830
Wait, Koby! If you're running away, then I'm coming with you!

125
00:17:00.280 --> 00:17:02.330
Return to the battlefield!

126
00:17:04.450 --> 00:17:07.390
Let me go! Please!

127
00:17:09.720 --> 00:17:11.940
It's Admiral Akainu! What's he doing here?

128
00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:16.380
I'm afraid of dying! When I think of my family, I can't even move!

129
00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:19.220
Please! I'm begging you! Please!

130
00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:23.780
We marines...

131
00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:30.220
fight against pirates and carry the justice of the world on our backs.

132
00:17:30.790 --> 00:17:34.910
Someone who runs away and lets an enemy see his back...

133
00:17:34.910 --> 00:17:37.730
has no right to call himself a marine!

134
00:17:37.730 --> 00:17:39.970
Someone like that is merely...

135
00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:41.220
trash!

136
00:17:45.490 --> 00:17:48.240
If you truly cared for your family,

137
00:17:48.240 --> 00:17:50.150
you wouldn't have disgraced them like this!

138
00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:59.120
N-No way! How could he do that to an ally?

139
00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:04.740
Admiral Sakazuki! We've finished preparing for the operation.

140
00:18:04.740 --> 00:18:07.480
Have you now? Finally!

141
00:18:14.100 --> 00:18:15.610
Operation?

142
00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:19.080
Ace!

143
00:18:22.360 --> 00:18:24.370
Commander Atmos!

144
00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:25.610
Why...

145
00:18:26.490 --> 00:18:28.700
My body's not listening to me...

146
00:18:28.700 --> 00:18:30.590
Stop this, Doflamingo!

147
00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:42.430
Pirates are evil? The Navy is righteous?

148
00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:44.730
Those views change as often as the tides!

149
00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:51.450
Kids who've never known peace have different values from those who've never known war.

150
00:18:51.960 --> 00:18:56.400
It's the job of those at the top to
decide what's good and what's evil.

151
00:18:56.400 --> 00:19:00.000
This place is the turning point.

152
00:19:02.860 --> 00:19:05.250
Justice will triumph, you say?

153
00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:07.260
Why of course!

154
00:19:10.570 --> 00:19:13.920
Because the winners will become justice!

155
00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:17.130
<b>Marineford - Bay Head</b>
Don't let them close the path Oars has opened!

156
00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:20.070
Advance into the bay!

157
00:19:22.610 --> 00:19:24.140
An icebreaker?

158
00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:27.190
It's the Ice Witch, Whitey Bay!

159
00:19:27.190 --> 00:19:30.130
Nothing to it.

160
00:19:30.130 --> 00:19:32.730
Now, all of you! Let's go!

161
00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:34.400
Thanks!

162
00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:36.720
Come on, men! Forward, into the bay!

163
00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:44.630
The bay's been breached in two spots!

164
00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:49.480
The Whitebeard Pirates and their allies are surging through both openings,

165
00:19:49.480 --> 00:19:54.330
and they're attacking the bay in large numbers, Fleet Admiral Sengoku!

166
00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:55.570
That's not a problem.

167
00:19:55.570 --> 00:19:56.270
What?

168
00:19:58.500 --> 00:20:01.260
Tsuru-san, commence the operation.

169
00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:04.230
<b>Marineford - Bay Head</b>

170
00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:02.840
At last.

171
00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:06.090
Move it! Or you'll be more than just wounded!

172
00:20:06.090 --> 00:20:07.390
Move it, old woman!

173
00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:10.560
I've been washed!

174
00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:12.020
I've been hung out to dry!

175
00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:14.120
But it feels so nice!

176
00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:17.130
You're a million years too young to stand a chance against me.

177
00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:20.400
Calling all ships and all men!

178
00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:37.630
You're planning something, aren't you?

179
00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:41.520
The Resourceful General, Sengoku the Buddha.

180
00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:46.890
Gramps!

181
00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:51.530
Why have you come here? Do you wish to protest against my plan?

182
00:20:51.530 --> 00:20:56.670
No, we're up against pirates. There's no room for sympathy.

183
00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:57.810
Then...

184
00:20:57.810 --> 00:20:58.700
Be silent!

185
00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:02.700
You don't mind, right?

186
00:21:05.090 --> 00:21:06.810
I'm just gonna sit here.

187
00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:19.260
You idiot! You too?!

188
00:21:19.260 --> 00:21:21.990
Don't hit Luffy, you damn geezer!

189
00:21:21.990 --> 00:21:23.160
"Damn"?!

190
00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:25.080
Ace, how dare you?!

191
00:21:27.400 --> 00:21:30.450
I have no sympathy for criminals...

192
00:21:34.220 --> 00:21:36.810
but for my family, I do.

193
00:21:38.570 --> 00:21:42.760
What... should I do?

194
00:21:46.260 --> 00:21:51.810
Damn you Ace! Why couldn't you just live as I told you?!

195
00:22:05.050 --> 00:22:05.750
Ace...

196
00:22:07.400 --> 00:22:11.180
You two are gonna become strong marines.

197
00:22:13.160 --> 00:22:14.870
You got that?

198
00:22:15.780 --> 00:22:18.660
You're gonna become strong marines.

199
00:22:25.720 --> 00:22:27.350
Gramps...!

200
00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:41.470
If you cause some sort of commotion here, I won't show you any mercy, Garp.

201
00:22:43.040 --> 00:22:45.940
If I was gonna do something, I'd have done it already.

202
00:22:46.860 --> 00:22:50.090
Did you hear their plan just now, Helmeppo-san?

203
00:22:50.090 --> 00:22:50.850
Yeah...

204
00:22:50.850 --> 00:22:54.970
They're gonna ignore Fire Fist Ace's scheduled execution time and just kill him now!

205
00:22:54.970 --> 00:22:56.620
If they do that...

206
00:22:57.790 --> 00:22:59.360
What's that?

207
00:23:04.290 --> 00:23:05.360
Is that...?

208
00:23:05.360 --> 00:23:06.500
Something's falling out of the sky!

209
00:23:07.990 --> 00:23:10.300
Is it a sneak attack from the Whitebeard Pirates?

210
00:23:32.740 --> 00:23:35.590
I knew you'd overdo it!

211
00:23:35.590 --> 00:23:37.060
This is all because of his wink.

212
00:23:37.060 --> 00:23:39.490
Vyou're blaming this on vme, Croco?!

213
00:23:39.490 --> 00:23:41.440
Who cares?! We're gonna die!

214
00:23:41.440 --> 00:23:43.620
The sea beneath us is frozen solid!

215
00:23:53.230 --> 00:23:55.910
Oh! I'm made of rubber, so I'll be fine!

216
00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.040
Then you'll be the only survivor!

217
00:23:58.040 --> 00:23:59.850
We have to do something!

218
00:23:59.850 --> 00:24:02.300
Vi don't want to die like this!

219
00:24:02.300 --> 00:24:04.090
Someone, stop vus!

220
00:24:04.090 --> 00:24:08.190
I never should've listened to you, Straw Hat!

221
00:24:08.190 --> 00:24:09.260
Dammit!

222
00:24:11.400 --> 00:24:15.930
Ace!

223
